      "title": "初始设定·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29506001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "嘿咻——到家啦。\n好安静，大家都已经睡了吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "这样也好，省得还要和|101|解释。\n就在梦里好好期待我为你准备的惊喜......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29506004",
              "text": "晚上好呀，有咲。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29506004",
              "text": "你回来了，有咲。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29506003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "是是是是你你你怎么还没睡？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "因为我在等你回家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "最近每天都早出晚归，还总是躲着我，发生了什么事吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "就是......呃，为了壮大「白鸟会」，在进行一些情报工作而已。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29506009",
              "text": "具体是什么？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29506009",
              "text": "没牵涉危险的事吧？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29506008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "很复杂......说了你也不懂。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "如果遭遇什么麻烦，一定要告诉我哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "放心吧，真的没事！\n我什么时候说过谎？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "......上次、上上次和......上上上次除外！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你一直背着手呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506014",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "！！？\n不好，偏偏就今天带回来了，同人本的手稿！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506015",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "这么羞耻的东西，怎么可以被|101|看到......\n对了，窗户！刚好爬窗过来，窗户开着！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是有东西藏在身后吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29506017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "呐！你看，我手里什么都没有。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29507001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红兔子",
          "text": "呜啊！我的眼睛！\n谁这么没素质，从窗户扔废纸下来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29507002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "黄兔子",
          "text": "《咖啡执事的狩猎》......图上画的是狩猎者大人？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29507003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红兔子",
          "text": "是吗？她换上这身装束更有魅力了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29507004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "黄兔子",
          "text": "快点把这些纸都收集起来，拿回去上报给狩猎者大人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
